      "problem": "Determine the solutions of the equation ${f}^{2}=-25.$",
      "worked_solution": "By taking square root, we obtain:\n\n$$\nf=\\pm \\sqrt{-25}\n$$\n\nWe now rewrite $f$ using the imaginary unit $\\text{i}=\\sqrt{-1}\\,:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f & =\\pm \\sqrt{-25} \\\\  & =\\pm \\sqrt{25\\cdot (-1)} \\\\  & =\\pm \\sqrt{25}\\cdot \\sqrt{-1} \\\\  & =\\pm 5\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
